Hi Nicholas,

Following our meeting on Monday, I have attached the current exception reques=
t procedure. This is the version Buying uses with requesters and approvers to=
day.

The urgent marking is there to get the request through the approval route mor=
e quickly; it does not tell you why the exception arose. If you are going to =
count causes, please look at the reason given on the request and the evidence=
 behind it, rather than treating the urgent flag as a cause in itself. Urgent=
 requests still come to Buying for a decision before an order is placed.

Neha, please let me know if the team needs help locating the supporting recor=
ds.

Best,
Meera

